14
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:21.432
¡Dámelo!

15
00:00:21.433 --> 00:00:22.265
¡De ninguna manera!

16
00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:23.432
¡Dámelo!

17
00:00:30.800 --> 00:00:31.598
